1
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:05,780
Alice Rondo-san.

2
00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:07,000
Here!

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:08,540
Chloe Aubert-san.

4
00:00:08,540 --> 00:00:09,370
Here.

5
00:00:09,980 --> 00:00:12,210
Okay, everyone's here.

6
00:00:12,210 --> 00:00:13,790
As I told you previously,

7
00:00:13,790 --> 00:00:16,450
I'll be leaving Freedom Academy 
at the end of the current term.

8
00:00:17,650 --> 00:00:18,900
Sensei...

9
00:00:19,950 --> 00:00:22,360
Hey, don't look so sad.

10
00:00:22,360 --> 00:00:24,460
I'll come back to visit all the time.

11
00:00:24,460 --> 00:00:26,750
Hmph. Don't bother.

12
00:00:26,750 --> 00:00:29,340
Yeah! It'll be a relief to have you gone!

13
00:00:29,340 --> 00:00:31,220
What's with the tough act?

14
00:00:31,220 --> 00:00:33,340
You guys just can't be 
honest with yourselves.

15
00:00:33,340 --> 00:00:36,550
Rimuru-sensei, you really 
will come visit, right?

16
00:00:36,550 --> 00:00:38,440
Yeah, of course.

17
00:00:38,440 --> 00:00:41,560
That said, we still have more 
than a month left until then.

18
00:00:41,560 --> 00:00:45,460
Also, you guys still have your 
finals to get through first,

19
00:00:45,460 --> 00:00:47,060
so you'd better study hard!

20
00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:49,760
Ugh, finals?

21
00:00:50,190 --> 00:00:52,570
Rimuru-sensei, I'm here.

22
00:00:52,570 --> 00:00:55,680
Oh, time for Tiss-sensei's class.

23
00:00:58,450 --> 00:00:59,460
Come on in.

24
00:00:59,930 --> 00:01:03,290
You guys better not make any 
trouble for Tiss-sensei, you hear?

25
00:01:03,290 --> 00:01:05,760
We wouldn't make any trouble.

26
00:01:05,760 --> 00:01:09,200
Tiss-sensei traveled to Guratol with us.

27
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:11,300
We have a pretty tight bond with her now.

28
00:01:12,540 --> 00:01:14,800
Yes, they're all great kids.

29
00:01:14,800 --> 00:01:16,990
Great kids, huh?

30
00:01:21,850 --> 00:01:24,780
Okay, Tiss-sensei, they're all yours.

31
00:01:24,780 --> 00:01:25,180
Sure.

32
00:01:25,180 --> 00:01:27,460
What're you going to do, Rimuru-sensei?

33
00:01:28,050 --> 00:01:29,810
Take a nap or something, I bet.

34
00:01:29,810 --> 00:01:31,210
Tsk, tsk, tsk!

35
00:01:31,210 --> 00:01:34,900
Alice-kun, despite appearances, 
I have quite a lot of work to do!

36
00:01:35,380 --> 00:01:36,990
Until next time, everyone!

37
00:01:36,990 --> 00:01:40,270
See you later, Rimuru-sensei!

38
00:01:41,890 --> 00:01:44,230
All right, let's start class.

39
00:01:44,230 --> 00:01:45,180
Yes, ma'am!

40
00:01:47,880 --> 00:01:50,880
Looks like she's getting 
along pretty well with them.

41
00:01:50,880 --> 00:01:51,880
Yes.

42
00:01:52,860 --> 00:01:56,790
I guess this means I can count on 
Tiss-sensei to take over for me.

43
00:01:56,790 --> 00:01:57,880
Well, then...

44
00:02:02,050 --> 00:02:04,710
Yes, I'm very busy.

45
00:02:04,710 --> 00:02:08,140
Not only do I have the kids of 
Freedom Academy to look after,

46
00:02:08,140 --> 00:02:12,890
but I also have lots to do for 
Tempest, our nation of monsters.

47
00:02:13,330 --> 00:02:14,180
Which means

48
00:02:14,180 --> 00:02:20,280
the Spatial Movement skill I got by analyzing 
that air spirit sure is coming in handy.

49
00:02:22,740 --> 00:02:26,410
Yep, looks like another 
peaceful day in Tempest.

50
00:02:27,830 --> 00:02:31,920
I'm Rimuru Tempest, and I'm a slime.

51
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:37,900
When I was a human, I was 
stabbed in a random attack,

52
00:02:37,900 --> 00:02:39,840
and I thought I had died...

53
00:02:44,220 --> 00:02:47,550
but I reincarnated in this world as a slime.

54
00:02:56,800 --> 00:02:59,830
I became friends with the 
Storm Dragon, Veldora...

55
00:03:09,490 --> 00:03:11,960
I built a nation of monsters...

56
00:03:23,810 --> 00:03:26,260
And I fought to protect everyone in it.

57
00:03:35,050 --> 00:03:36,770
Shizu-san's lingering regret...

58
00:03:48,340 --> 00:03:49,660
was those kids,

59
00:03:51,980 --> 00:03:54,320
and I succeeded in saving them.

60
00:03:58,060 --> 00:04:00,030
Now we can rest easy.

61
00:04:09,100 --> 00:04:12,160
My time as a teacher is almost over now.

62
00:04:12,160 --> 00:04:16,330
There sure have been lots of ups and downs,

63
00:04:16,330 --> 00:04:19,110
and a lot of pretty tough times, but now...

64
00:04:19,110 --> 00:04:23,440
You know, Ranga, I hope this 
peace will last forever.

