583
00:06:07,060 --> 00:06:10,270
I got involved in a bit of a mess 
with the Demon Lord Carrion,

584
00:06:10,270 --> 00:06:13,780
but then we signed a non-aggression 
pact, ending all hostilities between us.

585
00:06:14,180 --> 00:06:16,840
Then I accepted Carrion's proposal

586
00:06:16,840 --> 00:06:21,060
that the Jura Tempest Federation 
and the Animal Kingdom of Eurazania

587
00:06:17,060 --> 00:06:23,770
Jura Tempest 
Federation

