593
00:06:21,060 --> 00:06:23,770
should each send out delegations 
to the other country.

594
00:06:24,450 --> 00:06:26,680
I appointed Benimaru to lead our delegation,

595
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:28,780
with Rigur as his assistant.

596
00:06:29,490 --> 00:06:32,190
Rigur has grown into such a fine man!

597
00:06:33,890 --> 00:06:37,970
Today is the momentous day upon 
which our delegation departs,

598
00:06:38,790 --> 00:06:42,290
and I'm back in Tempest to see them off.

599
00:06:48,090 --> 00:06:50,300
Hmm, not bad.

600
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:58,050
Urgh... This shape is kinda hard to hold...

601
00:06:58,050 --> 00:07:00,000
Great Rimuru, thank you for waiting.

602
00:07:01,320 --> 00:07:04,940
We've selected some ceremonial 
outfits for you to choose from.

603
00:07:05,280 --> 00:07:06,550
Th-Thanks!

604
00:07:06,550 --> 00:07:09,000
I guess I'll try them on right now.

605
00:07:18,410 --> 00:07:21,420
I don't think this is quite right...

606
00:07:22,020 --> 00:07:24,130
Then how about this one?

607
00:07:25,580 --> 00:07:28,630
Huh?! I don't know about this one, either...

608
00:07:29,370 --> 00:07:31,300
I recommend this one!

609
00:07:35,590 --> 00:07:37,070
You look fantastic, Great Rimuru!

610
00:07:37,070 --> 00:07:39,060
It suits you perfectly!

611
00:07:39,060 --> 00:07:41,310
Listen, Shuna, Shion...

612
00:07:43,710 --> 00:07:47,940
I think something more somber and 
respectful would be more appropriate.

613
00:07:47,940 --> 00:07:51,010
More somber and respectful?

614
00:07:51,010 --> 00:07:54,320
This delegation is important 
to the future of Tempest.

615
00:07:54,320 --> 00:07:56,990
I want to send them off right.

616
00:07:57,400 --> 00:07:58,630
I see!

617
00:07:59,200 --> 00:08:02,460
We do have some things that 
are somber and respectful.

618
00:08:09,420 --> 00:08:11,010
Hey, it's starting.

619
00:08:12,530 --> 00:08:14,510
Great Rimuru!

620
00:08:18,520 --> 00:08:20,760
Great Rimuru looks amazing!

621
00:08:20,760 --> 00:08:21,920
Doesn't he, Gobzo?!

622
00:08:22,890 --> 00:08:24,630
Y-You look great!

623
00:08:24,630 --> 00:08:26,510
So do you, Sir Gabiru!

624
00:08:26,510 --> 00:08:27,120
Indeed!

625
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:28,190
Not bad.

626
00:08:28,190 --> 00:08:30,680
Master, you look splendid!

627
00:08:30,680 --> 00:08:32,780
Everyone, be silent!

628
00:08:43,210 --> 00:08:46,790
I wish you all the best in 
carrying out this mission.

629
00:08:52,380 --> 00:08:53,840
That's it?

630
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:55,740
Was that too short?!

631
00:08:57,500 --> 00:08:59,390
Okay, I'll add a bit more.

632
00:09:01,220 --> 00:09:05,220
Tempest has grown vastly more 
prosperous than it was before,

633
00:09:05,220 --> 00:09:07,690
but it is still inexperienced as a nation.

634
00:09:08,770 --> 00:09:11,990
If we can build a favorable 
relationship with Eurazania,

635
00:09:11,990 --> 00:09:14,410
we can find ways to utilize the 
things that make their nation great,

636
00:09:14,410 --> 00:09:17,740
which will help our own nation 
progress even further.

637
00:09:18,140 --> 00:09:19,200
However...

