00:17:39,870 --> 00:17:43,380
Wow, he sent his highest-ranking 
subordinates?

9020
00:17:43,380 --> 00:17:44,740
You gotta be kidding!

9021
00:17:45,960 --> 00:17:50,340
I came along 'cause I wondered what kind 
of monster the leader of Tempest was,

9022
00:17:50,300 --> 00:17:56,260
Animal Kingdom of Eurazania  Three Beastketeers

