and you're just a wussy, little slime?

9029
00:17:52,590 --> 00:17:55,130
If you wanna screw with us, 
you can only take it so far!

9030
00:17:56,260 --> 00:17:58,960
Wow, that one looks pretty strong, too.

9031
00:17:58,960 --> 00:18:00,600
Stand down, Suphia.

9032
00:18:01,010 --> 00:18:05,620
You may as well be slinging mud 
directly onto Lord Carrion's face.

9033
00:18:05,620 --> 00:18:09,140
Oh, shut up, Albis. 
You can't order me around.

9034
00:18:09,140 --> 00:18:11,440
Besides, Dwarves are one thing,

9035
00:18:11,440 --> 00:18:13,360
but humans, too?

9036
00:18:13,360 --> 00:18:16,900
Anyone who pals around with 
puny, insolent, cowardly humans

9037
00:18:16,900 --> 00:18:18,950
is a disgrace to all monsters!

9038
00:18:20,890 --> 00:18:22,660
That's quite the take.

9039
00:18:23,110 --> 00:18:25,120
Youm here is my friend,

9040
00:18:25,120 --> 00:18:28,170
as well as a fellow student under 
the same master who taught me.

9041
00:18:28,170 --> 00:18:29,790
Yeah? So what?

9042
00:18:31,680 --> 00:18:32,790
Hey, Youm...

9043
00:18:32,790 --> 00:18:35,760
It bugs you to know she just 
made fun of you, doesn't it?

9044
00:18:36,210 --> 00:18:39,470
Why don't you show her what 
you can do? I'll allow it.

9045
00:18:39,900 --> 00:18:43,350
Whoa, hang on! Weren't we 
gonna be peaceful about this?!

9046
00:18:43,350 --> 00:18:45,960
I wasn't planning to start any fights,

9047
00:18:45,960 --> 00:18:48,850
but if the other side does, 
that's another matter.

9048
00:18:49,230 --> 00:18:52,510
Oh? You wanna play, human?

9049
00:18:54,500 --> 00:18:55,810
Uh, I...

9050
00:18:55,810 --> 00:18:58,160
Go get 'er, boss!

9051
00:18:58,160 --> 00:19:00,650
We can't let her make us look like losers!

9052
00:19:00,650 --> 00:19:02,470
Please do the honors, Youm!

9053
00:19:04,900 --> 00:19:06,700
All right, fine.

9054
00:19:10,630 --> 00:19:13,080
Master, be sure to clean up 
the mess when I'm done, okay?

9055
00:19:13,080 --> 00:19:16,160
Hah! You're asking a slime 
to clean up the mess?

9056
00:19:16,160 --> 00:19:17,380
Don't make me laugh!

9057
00:19:17,380 --> 00:19:19,970
Sure, I'll take care of... it?

9058
00:19:19,970 --> 00:19:22,470
Um... Shion-san?

9059
00:19:22,470 --> 00:19:27,280
All she's done since she arrived 
is hurl insults toward you.

9060
00:19:27,640 --> 00:19:30,480
I've put up with it all this time,

9061
00:19:30,480 --> 00:19:33,150
but it looks like there 
was never any need to!

9062
00:19:34,960 --> 00:19:35,690
Huh?

9063
00:19:36,360 --> 00:19:37,990
Wha... um...

9064
00:19:37,990 --> 00:19:40,290
It's me you'll be fighting.

9065
00:19:41,380 --> 00:19:42,490
Oh?

9066
