00:21:31,890 --> 00:21:34,020
Don't underestimate me, Lycanthrope.

9094
00:21:34,020 --> 00:21:38,060
The power of a Kijin can rend the 
heavens and shatter the earth!

9095
00:21:40,530 --> 00:21:41,980
I'll show you that right now!

